---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Colophon · Ayaan Retiwala"
  description="Credits for the photography, typography, and sky rendering on lolwierd.com."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">colophon</h1>

  <section class="colophon">
    <p class="note">
      the mountain photo is by Alexis Rodriguez, taken at Annapurna I
      in Nepal. it's from <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/a-mountain-range-with-snow-covered-mountains-in-the-background-8eo8PsNIrNs" rel="noreferrer">Unsplash</a>, used under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" rel="noreferrer">Unsplash License</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="note note-secondary">
      the sky follows the time of day and lunar phase over Vadodara. the sun and
      moon dim when they overlap the text, and clouds thin out so the writing
      stays readable. clouds and terrain use the same dithered texture.
      headings use Iowan Old Style where
      available, with a serif fallback; small labels use Departure Mono.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .colophon {
      width: min(100%, 40rem);
    }

    .note {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink-dim);
      font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem) / 1.65 var(--serif);
      letter-spacing: -0.012em;
      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .note-secondary {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    }
  </style>
</PageLayout>
